>>
endobj
86 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (municipal authorities and public institutions alike. Between rising electricity prices, stricter environmental regulations, and growing pressure to reduce carbon footprints, decision-makers are increasingly looking for data-driven tools that can help them anticipate consumption spikes and detect inefficiencies before they become costly.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
87 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 10 0 R
