242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (This project delivered a complete Big Data processing chain addressing the energy consumption prediction problem. On the infrastructure side, we set up an HDP 3.0 platform with HDFS, Hive, Spark, and Zeppelin running inside a Docker container. On the data warehouse side, we built a layered Hive architecture with external tables for raw ingestion, a managed Parquet table partitioned by year and month for analytical queries, two operational views, and a materialized view with its REBUILD mechanism. The EXPLAIN command confirmed that partition pruning is active and that CBO optimization is applied.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
