/Title (Random Forest Regressor \(numTrees=20, maxDepth=5\): an ensemble of 20 decision trees trained in parallel on random subsets of the data and features. The final prediction is the average of all individual tree predictions. This ensemble approach reduces variance, handles non-linear relationships naturally, and is more robust to outliers than linear regression.)
