/Title (of the HDFS directories containing the raw CSV files. External tables were chosen deliberately at this stage: unlike managed tables, they do not take ownership of the underlying files. If the table is dropped, the data on HDFS is left untouched. This makes external tables the right tool for the raw ingestion layer, where preserving the source files regardless of any schema changes is a priority.)
